1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,949
It was august 27 th and we had just set out on our grand adventure.
那是八月二十七日，我们刚刚踏上这趟大冒险。

2
00:00:06,959 --> 00:00:13,600
So we were driving up to whistler for the evening just to stay overnight so we didn't have to get up super super early the next day.
我们当晚开车去惠斯勒住一夜，这样第二天就不用起得特别特别早。

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,359
The drive is about an hour and a half but we did stop in squamish for some food and whatnot.
车程大约一个半小时，不过我们在斯阔米什停了一下，吃点东西之类的。

4
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:25,840
And then we also went to the village to gather some supplies for dinner which we decided to make burgers.
然后我们还去村里采购晚饭用的食材，决定做汉堡。

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:33,200
I got these gluten free buns that actually tasted like play doh but the rest of the burgers were good.
我买的无麸质面包坯吃起来居然像培乐多彩泥，不过汉堡的其他部分还挺好。

6
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,400
And once we had dinner we just kind of hung out for a bit and then went to bed.
吃完晚饭后，我们就一起待了一会儿，然后上床睡觉了。

7
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:53,270
Time to go to bed it's the night before the hike see you tomorrow.
该睡觉啦，明天就要徒步了。明天见。

8
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:58,079
July 28 th I got up bright and early at 6 30 in the morning.
七月二十八日，我早早起床，时间是早上六点半。

9
00:00:58,079 --> 00:01:04,640
Made myself a coffee and then crafted two beautiful sandwiches to accompany me for my hike for my lunch.
我给自己做了杯咖啡，又做了两个漂亮的三明治，带去徒步当午饭。

10
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:11,030
Then I made a protein smoothie and had some toast among other things and then got dressed to go on the hike.
然后我做了蛋白饮，还吃了吐司和一些别的东西，接着换衣服准备去徒步。

11
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:19,590
Outfit is on so we left it around 8 30 and then ended up getting there around 9 to begin the hike.
衣服换好了。我们大约八点半出发，九点左右到达，开始徒步。

12
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:25,110
Get him I'm definitely going to get it like out of view yeah over can you give us a spin please.
拍他。我要让它移出画面。对，过去一点。能请你给我们转一圈看看吗？

13
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:31,679
Oh yeah oh yeah oh yeah and so the hike began.
哦耶，哦耶，哦耶。就这样，徒步开始了。

14
00:01:31,679 --> 00:01:35,280
I actually did this hike last year with my dad I don't know if you guys saw that video.
其实去年我和爸爸走过这条路线，不知道你们有没有看过那支视频。

15
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:41,840
But this time was a little bit different as we were camping overnight it has commenced.
但这次有些不同，因为我们要在山上露营过夜。开始了。

16
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:45,920
For some reason going into this hike I was so convinced I would be completely fine.
不知为什么，开始这次徒步前，我非常确信自己会完全没问题。

17
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:54,720
And that the extra 30 lbs on my back 30 to 40 lb on my back would not be much of an issue and boy was I wrong.
我还以为背上多出三十磅、三十到四十磅的重量不会造成什么问题，结果我可真想错了。

18
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:58,789
Luckily our campground was about 8 km into the hike.
幸运的是，我们的营地大约在走进这条路线八公里的地方。

19
00:01:58,799 --> 00:02:06,400
Unfortunately though it was 8 km of straight uphill and 900 m of elevation it's currently 9 43.
可惜，这八公里一路上坡，爬升九百米。现在是九点四十三分。

20
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:10,320
We've done 2 38 kilometers.
我们已经走了字幕写作 2 38 的公里数，具体数字断句尚待确认。

21
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:18,000
Despite the difficulty we persevered nonetheless taking quite a few breaks along the way.
尽管很难走，我们还是坚持了下来，一路上休息了不少次。

22
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:24,550
And eventually we got up to the campground around 11 30.
最终，我们大约十一点半到达营地。

23
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:32,710
Currently at the campsite trying to find a place to lay down our stuff so let's get let's get going.
现在在营地，正想找个地方把东西放下来。那我们，开始吧。

24
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:48,959
Let's go it's beautiful should I keep going keep rolling keep on rolling boy yay our home for the night.
走吧，真美。要继续吗？继续拍，继续拍。耶，这就是我们今晚的家。

25
00:02:48,959 --> 00:02:55,350
Once we arrived at the campsite we just kind of set everything up because we didn't really want to do it when we got back.
一到营地，我们就先把东西都安顿好，因为不想等回来之后再弄。

26
00:02:55,360 --> 00:03:00,160
So we set up our tent we actually put the pegs in the wrong way the first time but anyway.
所以我们搭起帐篷。其实第一次把帐篷钉插反了，不过，反正……

27
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:05,280
We set up our tent sleeping bag all that kind of stuff and then we had some lunch.
我们把帐篷、睡袋之类的都安顿好了，然后吃了午饭。

28
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:13,999
I had two sandwiches for lunch as I was very hungry and then we kind of got ready to go for the next leg of our trip.
我午饭吃了两个三明治，因为当时很饿。之后，我们就准备开始旅程的下一段。

29
00:03:13,999 --> 00:03:21,840
We started the next leg of the hike at around 1 00 and it was about 5 and 1 2 km to get up to panorama ridge.
我们大约一点开始下一段徒步，到 Panorama Ridge 大约还要走五公里半。

30
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:32,280
And the hike up there was genuinely so beautiful all the wild flowers were out and it's just kind of otherworldly up there.
往上走的沿途真的很美，野花全开了，上面简直像另一个世界。

31
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:20,960
All right there's where we're headed go right ahead perfect all right.
好，我们要去的地方就在那儿。请往前走。很好，好。

32
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:26,080
So this is where we're going to we're going to go hike up there perfect.
所以这就是我们要去的地方，我们会徒步走上那儿。很好。

33
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:34,480
We are currently up in the meadow we have how many kilometers are like three think about 2 km in.
我们现在在草甸里。还剩多少公里来着，三公里左右？我想已经走了大约两公里……

34
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:37,800
Our we have about two and a half three kilometers.
我们大约还有两公里半到三公里。

35
00:04:37,999 --> 00:04:42,309
You don't see that every day don't see that every day you really don't.
这种景色可不是每天都能见到。不是每天都能见到，真的。

36
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:45,280
I don't think I'll ever get over how beautiful this hike is.
我觉得自己永远都不会对这条徒步路线的美景习以为常。
